    "Review every value. A field that already holds something stays as it is unless you turn it on. Nothing is written until you press Fill.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "راجع كل قيمة. الحقل الذي فيه شيء يبقى كما هو ما لم تفعّله. لا يُكتب شيء حتى تضغط «تعبئة»."
          }
